That completes Unit Five. Next, we'll
start Unit Six: systems of equations. If

144
00:10:44,095 --> 00:10:49,457
this helped, subscribe to School Math,
Explained, and turn on notifications so

145
00:10:49,457 --> 00:10:51,725
you don't miss it. See you there.

